# Public Supabase project for dentist sign-in, loaded by `npm run build`. The anon key is public by design:
# the only table (dentist_profiles) has row-level security, each dentist reads and writes only their own row.
# Clinical data never goes to Supabase. To use your own project, put your values in .env.local (it overrides this).
